{"version":1,"key":"card:675","content":{"id":675,"content":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"nonce","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"integrity","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 是用于增强 Web 安全两个属性：","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"nonce","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 全称 Number used ONCE（一次性数字），是一种白名单机制来防止 XSS 攻击","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"如果没有 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"nonce","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，那么攻击者注入的内联 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"script","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 脚本即可任意执行，为了防止内联脚本执行，只要​","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"不在","type":"formatted"},{"text":" CSP 中设置 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"unsafe-url","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 即可，那么任何内联脚本都会被禁止执行，这样虽然解决了 XSS 的内联脚本执行，但是某些场景下需要动态生成内联脚本，自己生成的脚本也无法执行了。","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"为了解决这个问题，可以使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"nonce","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 属性。具体办法是在生成内联脚本时，同时生成一次性（每次都要动态生成，不能相同）的随机字符串，并且设置为 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"script","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 标签的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"nonce","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 属性，并且在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Content-Security-Policy","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 指定","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<script nonce=\"R4nd0mStr1ng\">\n  console.log(\"这段代码会被执行，因为 nonce 匹配\");\n</script>","language":"HTML","type":"code-block","uuid":"7d7c8810-93d3-417a-800d-4af96783bd69"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"Content-Security-Policy: script-src ’nonce-R4nd0mStr1ng’","language":"HTTP","type":"code-block","uuid":"1585f9f8-3def-4392-9109-097330aae4df"},{"children":[{"text":"浏览器会对比标签上的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"nonce","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 属性和响应头的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"nonce","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，如果二者匹配，那么该脚本就可以被执行，否则就会被拦截。","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"integrity","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 全称 Subresource Integrity (SRI，子资源完整性)，它的作用是防止第三方资源（如 CDN）被篡改","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"如果你引用第三方的 CDN 资源，如果该第三方网站被攻击，黑客替换了脚本内容，在此脚本中黑客即可为所欲为，如窃取数据，植入挖矿代码或者跳转到非法地址，带来财产和声誉上的损失。","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"calloutType":"danger","children":[{"children":[{"text":"有一个亲身经历，在高德的 M 站中，为了开发调试，引用了线上的 CDN 资源，但是此 CDN 被黑客攻破，脚本内容被替换，如果用户从别的网站跳转到该网站，那么会自动跳转到一个赌博网站，此事不仅被 CEO 发现，而且还加班到凌晨四点才发现该问题并解决。","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"危险","type":"callout"},{"children":[{"text":"为了保证我们引用的是正确的资源，我们可以在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"integrity","type":"formatted"},{"text":"指定资源的 hash 值，如果脚本被篡改，那么浏览器计算出的 hash 值就会与我们指定的不一样，那么就可以认为脚本被修改了，浏览器就会拒绝执行","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<script \n  src=\"https://example.com/example-framework.js\" \n  integrity=\"sha384-Li9vy3DqF8tnTXuiaAJuML3ky+er10rcgNR/A9W38174FqH7jNxk8+ul7jWd\" \n  crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n</script>","language":"HTML","type":"code-block","uuid":"a94e20a1-de42-40a0-9c8c-e48b3124eba8"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"integrity","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的格式为加密哈希算法的前缀（如 sha256, sha384, sha512）和 Base64 编码的哈希值。","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"calloutType":"info","children":[{"children":[{"text":"由于浏览器需要读取文件内容，因此通常配合 ","type":"formatted"},{"type":"content-link","contentId":5140,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","refId":674,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"crossorigin=\"anonymous\"","code":true}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性，否则无法获取内容，导致验证失败，脚本无法执行。"}],"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"信息","type":"callout"}],"type":"list-item"}],"type":"bulleted-list"}],"tags":["HTML/nonce","HTML/integrity","安全/CSP"],"createTime":1769096078276,"updateTime":1775707781091,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1775707781091},"links":{"card:674":{"key":"card:674","type":"card","id":674}}}